              "format": 0,
              "mode": "normal",
              "style": "",
              "text": "Witch Hazel, Rose, Mallow, Linden, Lavender, and Cornflower hydrosols help purify, soothe, and rebalance the skin, providing comfort, freshness, and radiance even to the most sensitive skin types. Acmella, known for its immediate natural lifting effect, helps smooth facial features, while the biomimetical peptide SYN®-COLL promotes collagen synthesis, improving skin elasticity and firmness. ",
