          "children": [
            {
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "mode": "normal",
              "style": "",
              "text": "Hyaluronic Acid ensures deep hydration and a plumping effect, while Panthenol and Aloe perform an important soothing, repairing, and protective action, helping to keep the skin soft, fresh, and perfectly balanced.",
